; C64 SYSTEM EQUATES
; ------------------
;
; Label names follow the Commodore KERNAL/BASIC source listings as published
; in "Mapping the Commodore 64" (Sheldon Leemon) and the "Commodore 64
; Programmer's Reference Guide", except where noted.
;
; Syntax:
; Use '=' for addresses
; and '<' for read addresses (ex: POTX)
; and '>' for write addresses (ex: FRELO1)
; and '#' for values

;
; 6510 ON-CHIP I/O PORT
;
D6510    =   $00
R6510    =   $01

